  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Green Cities 2 W2 E2 - Tbilisi Landfill Gas Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The investment will address the priority needs of the City identified under the  Green City Action Plan (&quot;GCAP&quot;). The Project will finance the closure,  remediation and final capping of the Didi Lilo landfill cells and installation  of a landfill gas (&quot;LFG&quot;) collection, flaring and utilisation (landfill  gas-to-energy conversion) system.  The Project aims to contribute to improved environment in Tbilisi. The Project  is part of Green Cities Framework 2 (&quot;GrCF2&quot;) and is the follow-on investment  under the Tbilisi&apos;s GCAP approved in September 2017. The Project will also  bring landfill operations in line with the relevant EU environmental standards.</narrative>
  </description>
